flowchart TD
    In[Input Message] --> Explicit{Mentions Bot Name?}
    Explicit -->|'AI Dost'| Dost[Assign AI Dost]
    Explicit -->|'AI Sathi'| Sathi[Assign AI Sathi]
    Explicit -->|Both sequentially| Dual[Schedule Dost then Sathi]
    Explicit -->|None| AIRelevance{AI/Tech Topic?}
    
    AIRelevance -->|No: Casual chatter| Silence[No Response / Silent]
    AIRelevance -->|Yes| ActiveCheck{Follow-up to active turn?}
    
    ActiveCheck -->|Yes| ContinueBot[Assign Last Active Bot]
    ActiveCheck -->|No| RoundRobin[Round Robin / Balance Bot Selection]
